       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INSPECT-VARIABLE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77 WS-TEXT PIC X(6).
       77 WS-PATTERN PIC X(4) VALUE "ABCD".
       77 WS-REPLACEMENT PIC X(4) VALUE "XYZW".
       77 WS-LENGTH PIC 9 VALUE 2.
       77 WS-COUNT PIC 9.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE "ABABBA" TO WS-TEXT.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-COUNT.
           INSPECT WS-TEXT TALLYING WS-COUNT
               FOR ALL WS-PATTERN(1:WS-LENGTH).
           DISPLAY "TALLY=" WS-COUNT.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-COUNT.
           INSPECT WS-TEXT TALLYING WS-COUNT FOR CHARACTERS
               AFTER INITIAL WS-PATTERN(1:WS-LENGTH).
           DISPLAY "AFTER=" WS-COUNT.
           INSPECT WS-TEXT REPLACING
               ALL WS-PATTERN(1:WS-LENGTH)
                   BY WS-REPLACEMENT(1:WS-LENGTH)
               FIRST "B" BY "Z".
           DISPLAY "MULTIPLE=" WS-TEXT.
           MOVE "ABABBA" TO WS-TEXT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LENGTH.
           INSPECT WS-TEXT REPLACING
               ALL WS-PATTERN(1:WS-LENGTH)
                   BY WS-REPLACEMENT(1:WS-LENGTH).
           DISPLAY "SINGLE=" WS-TEXT.
           MOVE "ABABBA" TO WS-TEXT.
           MOVE 2 TO WS-LENGTH.
           INSPECT WS-TEXT CONVERTING WS-PATTERN(1:WS-LENGTH)
               TO WS-REPLACEMENT(1:WS-LENGTH).
           DISPLAY "CONVERT=" WS-TEXT.
           STOP RUN.
